gtk4sermo (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging for gtk4sermo — Haplo-Linux fork.
  * GTK4 dialog window creator for shell scripts.
  * Toolkit: GTK4.
  * Security hardening: safe_exec, FORTIFY_SOURCE=2, PIE, Full RELRO,
    stack-protector-strong.

 -- Haplo-Linux Development Team <devel@haplo-dialog.fr>  Fri, 29 May 2026 12:00:00 +0200
